{"id":"64f9cabc19eb","path":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/visiting-researchers","lang":"en","title":"Visiting researchers","description":"","section":"Relint","crumbs":["Relint","Specific information for:"],"image":null,"words":194,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/relint/informazioni-specifiche/ricercatori-in-visita","en":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/visiting-researchers"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"Relint","path":"/en/university/info/relint"},{"label":"Specific information for:","path":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information"},{"label":"Visiting researchers","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Academic Visiting Researcher"},{"t":"html","html":"<p>In general, the host institute or research center is responsible for most organizational aspects. It is therefore essential to establish direct contact with your reference person within the host unit.<br> For a list of USI research institutes, please visit: <a href=\"/en/research/institutes\">https://www.usi.ch/en/research/institutes</a></p> <p><strong>Invitation Letter</strong><br> The host entity (institute, research center, or laboratory) is responsible for selecting the candidate and issuing the invitation letter, which should ideally be received at least three months prior to arrival—especially for candidates coming from non-EU countries.<br> The host also provides the necessary infrastructure and serves as the main contact point for all administrative formalities and practical onboarding upon arrival.</p> <p><strong>Funding and Contracts</strong><br> Typically, visiting scholars work for a limited period <strong>without a formal employment contract with USI</strong>. Therefore, any funding (e.g., Erasmus+) should be arranged through the home institution.</p> <p>Further relevant information is available on the USI website: <a href=\"/en/university/info/academic-staff\">https://www.usi.ch/en/university/info/academic-staff</a></p>"},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Students from European or non-European universities interested in an internship mobility period at a USI Institute or Affiliated Center"},{"t":"html","html":"<p>Please refer to the dedicated <a href=\"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-mobility-for-internship\">page</a>. </p>"},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Swiss Government Excellence Scholarship Holders"},{"t":"html","html":"<p>Please refer to the dedicated <a href=\"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/swiss-government-excellence-scholarships\">page</a>. </p>"},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Scholars at Risk"},{"t":"html","html":"<p>Please refer to the dedicated <a href=\"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/scholars-at-risk-network\">page</a>.</p>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"International Relations and Study Abroad","href":"/en/university/info/relint"},{"label":"Governance","href":"/en/universita/info/relint/governance"},{"label":"Strategy and objectives 2025-2028","href":"/en/university/info/relint/international-relations/internationalization-strategy-goals"},{"label":"International relations commission","href":"/en/university/info/relint/commission"},{"label":"International collaborations","href":"/en/university/info/relint/international-relations/partnerships"},{"label":"Annual report","href":"/en/university/info/relint/annual-report"},{"label":"Statistical data","href":"/en/university/info/relint/exchange/figures"},{"label":"All categories","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information"},{"label":"USI students","href":"/en/university/info/relint/usi-student"},{"label":"Incoming exchanges","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-exchange-students"},{"label":"Incoming internships","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-mobility-for-internship"},{"label":"InclUSIone","href":"/en/university/info/relint/inclusione"},{"label":"ESKAS scholarship holders","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/swiss-government-excellence-scholarships"},{"label":"Scholars at Risk","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/scholars-at-risk-network"},{"label":"USI academic staff","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/academic-staff"},{"label":"USI staff","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/administrative-staff"},{"label":"Incoming academic body","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-academic-staff"},{"label":"Incoming staff","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-staff-mobilities"},{"label":"Visiting researchers","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/visiting-researchers"},{"label":"External organisations","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/external-organizations"},{"label":"Partner universities","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/universita-partner"},{"label":"Interested universities","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/universities-interested"},{"label":"Internationalisation at home - I@H","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/internationalization-at-home"},{"label":"\"Come and Go\" newsletter","href":"/en/university/info/relint/come-go-archive"},{"label":"Events","href":"/en/university/info/relint/events"},{"label":"Il mondo in USI","href":"/en/university/info/relint/il-mondo-in-usi"},{"label":"News","href":"/en/university/info/relint/news"},{"label":"Team and contacts","href":"/en/university/info/relint/team"},{"label":"2005-2025: 20 years of activity","href":"/en/university/info/relint/20-years-of-activity"}],"links":[],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/visiting-researchers","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T17:57:59.362Z"}